  "bookRefs": [
    "R-LOCK-3",
    "READ-REFRESH"
  ],
  "description": "Process a holds a dynaset, a snapshot and a table-type recordset (index PK_T) positioned on row 1 and reads each. Process b then changes N of row 1 (to 1001, 1002, ... in five successive Execute statements); after each change a applies one technique and reads row 1 through the three held cursors: no call at all, DBEngine.Idle(dbRefreshCache), Move 0, Requery, MoveFirst, in that order. Finally a opens a new dynaset and reads. Member and value are read together; every call result and error is recorded.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
